product.description:
Our expertly designed flat panel radiators deliver exceptional output, efficient heating, and outstanding reliability. Each unit undergoes individual testing.
We offer 15 size variations in either double or single panel and 3 different colour options  for each! Choose from: Black, White or Anthracite. We offer this comprehensive range of options to ensure you can upgrade your radiators in every room of your home, all from a single source and at a great price. Furthermore, we also offer matching valves. Begin your search by looking for &apos;Mcc Radiator&apos; or &apos;Mcc valve.&apos;

Valves Not Included*

RopeServices UK
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Pack of 8 x Powder Coated Black Decking Rope Cup Ends To Fit 40mm Rope.
&amp;nbsp;
Each Fitting Is Complete With All Fixing Screws
&amp;nbsp;


Screw the three fixing screws provided to your desired location.

Remove the centre screw, insert your rope, and use a 5mm engineering screwdriver to form a pilot hole through the rope,
&amp;nbsp;then insert centre screw using a screwdriver.

Our rope fittings are manufactured from solid brass, they are designed to withstand rust.
&amp;nbsp;
These are an excellent choice for outdoor and indoor use.
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
RopeServices UK offers a wide range of decking rope fittings from 20mm up to 50mm diameter.
&amp;nbsp;
These fittings are designed solely to fit our ropes.
&amp;nbsp;
Finishes Available - Polished Brass, Polished Chrome, Satin Nickel, Copper Bronze, Powder Coated Black, Gun Metal Black, Antique Brass
&amp;nbsp;
Fittings Available - Hooks, Eyeplates, Cup Ends, Handrail Brackets, End Caps
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Our fittings are the perfect choice to finish any project, adding a touch of luxury and style.
&amp;nbsp;
&amp;nbsp;
Approximate Dimensions:
&amp;nbsp;
Centre Hole - 41mm
Baseplate - 72mm
Height - 40mm
&amp;nbsp;
Centre Screw - 50mm

